# Content outputs

Use this file to record output from running the project code. Add a new section for each run with:
- Date/time of the run.
- Command executed and key parameters.
- Brief summary of stdout/stderr or generated artifacts.
- Notes about any issues encountered.

Example entry:
```
## 2024-05-12 - Portfolio optimization
Command: python "Portfolio Pipeline/main.py" --tickers "AAPL MSFT" --start-date 2022-01-01 --end-date 2024-01-01 --ipopt-path ./bin/ipopt
Output: Saved plots to ./outputs/efficient_frontier.png; allocations logged to ./outputs/allocation.csv
Notes: IPOPT warned about max iterations; try increasing iteration limit if re-running.
```
